Third-party notice — bundled voice lines

The WAV files under `sounds/` were synthesized locally with
VOICEVOX (https://voicevox.hiroshiba.jp/), which is free for personal and
commercial use under its own terms. Each VOICEVOX character voice has its
own usage guidelines; when redistributing a voice pack, check the
guidelines of the specific character voice you ship. This plugin does not
redistribute the VOICEVOX engine itself.
